    "title": "Universal TV Remote Control",
    "description": "Would you like to use Universal TV Remote Control for all TVs in all countries? Then Universal Remote Controller with android tv remote\r\nis for you.\r\n\r\nA smart TV remote app is a free app to control your smart television through tv remote universal control Wi-Fi and a built-in IR Blaster with Tv remote app. With Wi-Fi, it is necessary that your Universal Remote app and smart Television are connected to the same network with android tv remote. For IR TVs, this universal TV remote control works if your mobile has the built-in infrared feature control remoto universal. Navigate on your smart television lcd universal remote control with easy controls, and play/pause/stop videos using the best free Remote for TV app.\r\n\r\nUniversal remote control for TV is very useful when you can't find your physical smart remote at your home. TV remote control for all TV  like remote control for tv Samsung will control universal all functionality from your mobile. You can use the remote for all TV brands. A universal TV remote for smart TV is a tool on your phone which can replace your physical remote like Samsung smart tv remote free from your phone. This free Universal TV remote for all TVs makes your life easy and relaxing.\r\n\r\nControl your television through smart TV remote control with Wi-Fi and IR functionalities. The smart remote control is easy and simple to use for all samsung remote. Universal TV remote app supports many TV brands. In this remote control for any TV, the IR feature is required to send signals from your mobile to any android tv remote, just like a simple and quick remote app. You can try this free universal smart TV remote control for all TV to convert your device functionality into a remote app. This app is very easy control remoto universal to configure for your television.\r\n\r\nFunctionalities of the Remote TV control app :\r\n\u2714\ufe0f Universal TV control Home screen tv remote samsung\r\n\u2714\ufe0f Simple ON / OFF Power control\r\n\u2714\ufe0f Mute / Un-Mute voice button\r\n\u2714\ufe0f Universal remote Channel index and lists button\r\n\u2714\ufe0f Up / Down / Left / Right Navigation.\r\n\u2714\ufe0f Volume Control button Up/ Down\r\n\u2714\ufe0f Universal TV Remote Control support most of major TV brands \r\n      like emerson tv remote app, samsung remote, hisense smart tv remote ,philips tv remote all in one control remoto universal.\r\n\r\nKey Feature of Remote control for TV app:\r\n\u2714\ufe0f Support all types of TV brands\r\n\u2714\ufe0f Power On/Off control from mobile\r\n\u2714\ufe0f Increase/Decrease Volume\r\n\u2714\ufe0f Change channels according to your mood\r\n\u2714\ufe0f Both IR and Wi-Fi functionalities supported\r\n\u2714\ufe0f Menu buttons with up/down and mute/unmute\r\n\u2714\ufe0f free to use for any smart remote for samsung tv etc\r\n\u2714\ufe0f mobile remotes control TV has a friendly user Interface\r\n\r\nUniversal TV Remote Control app supported TV brands and control tv:\r\n\u2022 Remote Control for Sony\r\n\u2022 Universal TV remote for Samsung remote TV\r\n\u2022 LG smart tv remote\r\n\u2022 Universal Remote Controller for Kenwood\r\n\u2022 Remote Control for TCL\r\n\u2022 Remote app for Gree\r\n\u2022 Universal TV remote for Vizio TV\r\n\u2022 Panasonic tv remote\r\n\u2022 Remote for Haier TV\r\n\u2022 led TV remote for Toshiba\r\n\u2022 Remote for Philips\r\n\u2022 led remote for Eco Star\r\n\u2022 Remote Control for Orient\r\n\u2022 Hisense smart tv remote\r\n\u2022 TV remote for Xiaomi and emerson tv remote\r\n\r\nA smart TV remote control that is powerful enough to support multiple TV brands, we highly commend you to download tv remote universal control and try to use our remote control universal for tv.\r\n\r\nNotice about Smart TV Remote for all TV:\r\n\r\nThis app requires Wi-Fi and IR blaster in Tv remote app, you should have an infrared sensor in your mobile phone. Either your phone and smart TV are connected to the same Wi-Fi network or you have IR built-in feature in your smartphone. Otherwise, this TV control remote app does not work.\r\n\r\nIf you found any issue with Universal TV remote control for all TV, then feels free to share your problems for any tv remote app with us through an email. So we can resolve the issue for you as soon as possible for control remoto universal. Enjoy the universal remote TV app for free.",
